{"id":"forecast-01","section":4,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-01/audio-4.mp3","model":"small","duration":1085.02,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":8.16,"text":"Part 4. You will hear a lecturer talking to a group of biology students about recent plant studies.","words":[["Part",0.0,0.56],["4.",0.56,0.96],["You",2.16,2.44],["will",2.44,2.62],["hear",2.62,2.86],["a",2.86,3.08],["lecturer",3.08,3.44],["talking",3.44,3.94],["to",3.94,4.22],["a",4.22,4.38],["group",4.38,4.6],["of",4.6,4.82],["biology",4.82,5.26],["students",5.26,5.9],["about",5.9,6.68],["recent",6.68,7.2],["plant",7.2,7.58],["studies.",7.58,8.16]]},{"start":9.1,"end":67.51,"text":"First you have some time to look at questions 31 to 40. Now listen carefully and answer questions 31 to 40.","words":[["First",9.1,9.76],["you",9.76,9.96],["have",9.96,10.12],["some",10.12,10.28],["time",10.28,10.64],["to",10.64,10.86],["look",10.86,10.98],["at",10.98,11.12],["questions",11.12,11.46],["31",11.46,12.2],["to",12.2,12.4],["40.",12.4,12.78],["Now",63.41,63.79],["listen",63.79,64.13],["carefully",64.13,64.61],["and",64.61,64.97],["answer",64.97,65.47],["questions",65.47,65.93],["31",65.93,66.83],["to",66.83,67.13],["40.",67.13,67.51]]},{"start":70.84,"end":77.6,"text":"Good morning everyone. In the last few weeks we looked at ways in which different types of animals use their senses.","words":[["Good",70.84,71.22],["morning",71.22,71.48],["everyone.",71.48,71.84],["In",72.68,72.88],["the",72.88,72.96],["last",72.96,73.2],["few",73.2,73.42],["weeks",73.42,73.8],["we",73.8,74.24],["looked",74.24,74.5],["at",74.5,74.68],["ways",74.68,74.92],["in",74.92,75.16],["which",75.16,75.32],["different",75.32,75.66],["types",75.66,76.02],["of",76.02,76.22],["animals",76.22,76.62],["use",76.62,76.98],["their",76.98,77.16],["senses.",77.16,77.6]]},{"start":77.6,"end":84.62,"text":"And today I'm going to introduce the topic of plant behaviour and we'll look at the","words":[["And",77.6,78.94],["today",78.94,79.38],["I'm",79.38,80.34],["going",80.34,80.5],["to",80.5,80.68],["introduce",80.68,81.08],["the",81.08,81.3],["topic",81.3,81.64],["of",81.64,82.04],["plant",82.04,82.44],["behaviour",82.44,83.04],["and",83.04,84.1],["we'll",84.1,84.24],["look",84.24,84.38],["at",84.38,84.5],["the",84.5,84.62]]},{"start":84.62,"end":89.18,"text":"reasons why ideas about plants have been changing in the last few years.","words":[["reasons",84.62,84.86],["why",84.86,85.18],["ideas",85.18,85.62],["about",85.62,85.9],["plants",85.9,86.4],["have",86.4,86.98],["been",86.98,87.14],["changing",87.14,87.64],["in",87.64,88.26],["the",88.26,88.34],["last",88.34,88.58],["few",88.58,88.8],["years.",88.8,89.18]]},{"start":90.52,"end":98.3,"text":"So up until fairly recently, plants lack of eyes or ears or noses or mouths made them","words":[["So",90.52,90.92],["up",90.92,91.28],["until",91.28,91.48],["fairly",91.48,91.88],["recently,",91.88,92.5],["plants",92.98,93.48],["lack",93.48,93.9],["of",93.9,94.08],["eyes",94.08,94.44],["or",94.44,95.06],["ears",95.06,95.5],["or",95.5,95.88],["noses",95.88,96.44],["or",96.44,96.66],["mouths",96.66,97.18],["made",97.18,98.12],["them",98.12,98.3]]},{"start":98.3,"end":102.74,"text":"less interesting to many members of the public compared to animal species.","words":[["less",98.3,98.54],["interesting",98.54,99.2],["to",99.2,99.54],["many",99.54,99.8],["members",99.8,100.08],["of",100.08,100.3],["the",100.3,100.4],["public",100.4,100.76],["compared",100.76,101.38],["to",101.38,101.8],["animal",101.8,102.26],["species.",102.26,102.74]]},{"start":102.74,"end":109.7,"text":"and even by scientists they were generally regarded as organisms which were essentially","words":[["and",102.74,103.9],["even",103.9,104.12],["by",104.12,104.38],["scientists",104.38,105.06],["they",105.06,105.5],["were",105.5,105.7],["generally",105.7,106.12],["regarded",106.12,106.68],["as",106.68,107.28],["organisms",107.28,107.94],["which",107.94,108.82],["were",108.82,109.08],["essentially",109.08,109.7]]},{"start":109.7,"end":118.1,"text":"passive. However, in the last 20 years or so, evidence has started to emerge that plants","words":[["passive.",109.7,110.24],["However,",111.24,112.04],["in",112.58,113.02],["the",113.02,113.14],["last",113.14,113.42],["20",113.42,113.82],["years",113.82,114.24],["or",114.24,114.5],["so,",114.5,114.82],["evidence",115.2,115.64],["has",115.64,116.2],["started",116.2,116.6],["to",116.6,116.8],["emerge",116.8,117.14],["that",117.14,117.44],["plants",117.44,118.1]]},{"start":118.1,"end":125.42,"text":"can sense their surroundings in quite sophisticated ways. But because scientific attitudes towards","words":[["can",118.1,118.74],["sense",118.74,119.14],["their",119.14,119.46],["surroundings",119.46,120.0],["in",120.0,120.86],["quite",120.86,121.1],["sophisticated",121.1,121.62],["ways.",121.62,122.34],["But",123.26,123.68],["because",123.68,123.9],["scientific",123.9,124.4],["attitudes",124.4,125.04],["towards",125.04,125.42]]},{"start":125.42,"end":132.26,"text":"plants and their capabilities had been fixed for such a long time, this evidence has","words":[["plants",125.42,126.06],["and",126.06,126.68],["their",126.68,126.88],["capabilities",126.88,127.54],["had",127.54,128.3],["been",128.3,128.5],["fixed",128.5,129.02],["for",129.02,129.4],["such",129.4,129.72],["a",129.72,129.84],["long",129.84,130.02],["time,",130.02,130.48],["this",131.04,131.28],["evidence",131.28,131.66],["has",131.66,132.26]]},{"start":132.26,"end":139.06,"text":"been met with some disbelief. So, let's look at some of these recent findings","words":[["been",132.26,132.46],["met",132.46,132.7],["with",132.7,132.92],["some",132.92,133.2],["disbelief.",133.2,133.92],["So,",135.16,135.5],["let's",136.26,137.24],["look",137.24,137.36],["at",137.36,137.54],["some",137.54,137.78],["of",137.78,137.94],["these",137.94,138.14],["recent",138.14,138.64],["findings",138.64,139.06]]},{"start":139.06,"end":143.5,"text":"that are starting to change the way some scientists view plant life.","words":[["that",139.06,139.46],["are",139.46,139.56],["starting",139.56,139.9],["to",139.9,140.14],["change",140.14,140.54],["the",140.54,140.82],["way",140.82,141.08],["some",141.08,141.5],["scientists",141.5,142.08],["view",142.08,142.7],["plant",142.7,143.12],["life.",143.12,143.5]]},{"start":144.76,"end":151.3,"text":"It all began with a Canadian study that looked at a species of plant known as the Great","words":[["It",144.76,145.08],["all",145.08,145.24],["began",145.24,145.6],["with",145.6,146.4],["a",146.4,146.54],["Canadian",146.54,146.94],["study",146.94,147.46],["that",147.46,148.24],["looked",148.24,148.46],["at",148.46,148.76],["a",148.76,148.88],["species",148.88,149.18],["of",149.18,149.5],["plant",149.5,149.84],["known",149.84,150.6],["as",150.6,150.82],["the",150.82,150.98],["Great",150.98,151.3]]},{"start":151.3,"end":159.64,"text":"Lakes Sea Rocket. This is a wild plant which grows on beaches. In appearance it's perfectly","words":[["Lakes",151.3,151.94],["Sea",151.94,152.54],["Rocket.",152.54,152.84],["This",153.8,154.22],["is",154.22,154.36],["a",154.36,154.48],["wild",154.48,154.9],["plant",154.9,155.44],["which",155.44,156.14],["grows",156.14,156.44],["on",156.44,156.7],["beaches.",156.7,157.0],["In",158.04,158.22],["appearance",158.22,158.56],["it's",158.56,159.1],["perfectly",159.1,159.64]]},{"start":159.64,"end":168.08,"text":"ordinary, with little purple flowers and a long stalk, but actually the plant is far from ordinary.","words":[["ordinary,",159.64,160.12],["with",160.56,161.02],["little",161.02,161.38],["purple",161.38,161.74],["flowers",161.74,162.3],["and",162.3,162.78],["a",162.78,162.94],["long",162.94,163.16],["stalk,",163.16,163.56],["but",164.42,164.6],["actually",164.6,165.0],["the",165.0,166.0],["plant",166.0,166.32],["is",166.32,166.96],["far",166.96,167.3],["from",167.3,167.58],["ordinary.",167.58,168.08]]},{"start":169.4,"end":177.18,"text":"Normally when the sea rocket detects other plants growing nearby it quickly grows additional roots.","words":[["Normally",169.4,170.2],["when",170.2,170.9],["the",170.9,171.1],["sea",171.1,171.26],["rocket",171.26,171.58],["detects",171.58,172.62],["other",172.62,172.78],["plants",172.78,173.14],["growing",173.14,173.48],["nearby",173.48,173.96],["it",173.96,174.88],["quickly",174.88,175.38],["grows",175.38,175.92],["additional",175.92,176.68],["roots.",176.68,177.18]]},{"start":177.96,"end":183.56,"text":"This is so it can compete with these other plants for the available nutrients in the soil","words":[["This",177.96,178.48],["is",178.48,178.62],["so",178.62,178.76],["it",178.76,178.9],["can",178.9,179.06],["compete",179.06,179.58],["with",179.58,179.9],["these",179.9,180.18],["other",180.18,180.58],["plants",180.58,181.04],["for",181.04,181.56],["the",181.56,181.7],["available",181.7,182.14],["nutrients",182.14,182.78],["in",182.78,183.12],["the",183.12,183.24],["soil",183.24,183.56]]},{"start":183.56,"end":191.0,"text":"by soaking up as many of them as possible. But scientists found that the sea rocket doesn't","words":[["by",183.56,184.34],["soaking",184.34,184.68],["up",184.68,184.96],["as",184.96,185.18],["many",185.18,185.5],["of",185.5,185.62],["them",185.62,185.76],["as",185.76,185.88],["possible.",185.88,186.28],["But",187.12,187.64],["scientists",187.64,188.02],["found",188.02,189.0],["that",189.0,189.48],["the",189.48,189.6],["sea",189.6,189.82],["rocket",189.82,190.14],["doesn't",190.14,191.0]]},{"start":191.0,"end":198.02,"text":"do that when the surrounding plants are related to it. And as even animals sometimes find","words":[["do",191.0,191.22],["that",191.22,191.46],["when",191.46,191.72],["the",191.72,191.9],["surrounding",191.9,192.38],["plants",192.38,192.94],["are",192.94,193.22],["related",193.22,193.68],["to",193.68,194.02],["it.",194.02,194.22],["And",195.36,196.04],["as",196.04,196.38],["even",196.38,196.64],["animals",196.64,197.12],["sometimes",197.12,197.64],["find",197.64,198.02]]},{"start":198.02,"end":204.36,"text":"this type of recognition difficult, such a finding was very unexpected. It was an ability","words":[["this",198.02,198.26],["type",198.26,198.5],["of",198.5,198.64],["recognition",198.64,199.04],["difficult,",199.04,199.7],["such",200.5,200.7],["a",200.7,200.84],["finding",200.84,201.12],["was",201.12,201.64],["very",201.64,201.98],["unexpected.",201.98,202.58],["It",203.56,203.74],["was",203.74,203.9],["an",203.9,204.02],["ability",204.02,204.36]]},{"start":204.36,"end":211.94,"text":"that was previously unheard of in any other plant. Since then it's been suggested that","words":[["that",204.36,205.0],["was",205.0,205.18],["previously",205.18,205.7],["unheard",205.7,206.54],["of",206.54,206.76],["in",206.76,207.0],["any",207.0,207.36],["other",207.36,207.52],["plant.",207.52,207.88],["Since",209.26,209.94],["then",209.94,210.28],["it's",210.28,210.7],["been",210.7,210.88],["suggested",210.88,211.36],["that",211.36,211.94]]},{"start":211.94,"end":219.26,"text":"The two other plants may have a similar ability. These are sagebrush and thorn apple. It's","words":[["The",211.94,212.06],["two",212.06,212.34],["other",212.34,212.84],["plants",212.84,213.28],["may",213.28,213.58],["have",213.58,213.82],["a",213.82,213.92],["similar",213.92,214.26],["ability.",214.26,214.78],["These",215.7,215.9],["are",215.9,216.12],["sagebrush",216.12,216.8],["and",216.8,217.6],["thorn",217.6,217.98],["apple.",217.98,218.24],["It's",219.06,219.26]]},{"start":219.26,"end":224.66,"text":"being claimed that these plants can recognise the characteristics of their neighbours by","words":[["being",219.26,219.42],["claimed",219.42,219.82],["that",219.82,220.18],["these",220.18,220.4],["plants",220.4,220.8],["can",220.8,221.38],["recognise",221.38,221.96],["the",221.96,222.34],["characteristics",222.34,222.84],["of",222.84,223.36],["their",223.36,223.54],["neighbours",223.54,223.92],["by",223.92,224.66]]},{"start":224.66,"end":230.5,"text":"sensing properties of the light that is reflected from them. The reason they are able to do","words":[["sensing",224.66,225.06],["properties",225.06,225.56],["of",225.56,225.94],["the",225.94,226.06],["light",226.06,226.42],["that",226.42,226.82],["is",226.82,226.96],["reflected",226.96,227.44],["from",227.44,227.8],["them.",227.8,228.0],["The",228.94,229.38],["reason",229.38,229.62],["they",229.62,229.8],["are",229.8,229.92],["able",229.92,230.12],["to",230.12,230.28],["do",230.28,230.5]]},{"start":230.5,"end":235.52,"text":"this is that all plant species are slightly different to each other in this respect.","words":[["this",230.5,230.78],["is",230.78,231.48],["that",231.48,231.66],["all",231.66,232.0],["plant",232.0,232.42],["species",232.42,232.84],["are",232.84,233.24],["slightly",233.24,233.72],["different",233.72,234.16],["to",234.16,234.4],["each",234.4,234.58],["other",234.58,234.78],["in",234.78,234.94],["this",234.94,235.1],["respect.",235.1,235.52]]},{"start":236.34,"end":241.82,"text":"So, each plant species has what you could call its own signature.","words":[["So,",236.34,237.02],["each",237.68,238.04],["plant",238.04,238.34],["species",238.34,238.72],["has",238.72,239.14],["what",239.14,239.38],["you",239.38,239.62],["could",239.62,239.86],["call",239.86,240.24],["its",240.24,240.62],["own",240.62,241.08],["signature.",241.08,241.82]]},{"start":242.94,"end":246.02,"text":"Sagebrush and Thornapple are able to recognise these.","words":[["Sagebrush",242.94,243.62],["and",243.62,244.08],["Thornapple",244.08,244.62],["are",244.62,244.84],["able",244.84,245.02],["to",245.02,245.18],["recognise",245.18,245.6],["these.",245.6,246.02]]},{"start":247.1,"end":252.36,"text":"But scientists point out that this behaviour is very different to the way that animals","words":[["But",247.1,247.34],["scientists",247.34,247.8],["point",247.8,248.4],["out",248.4,248.68],["that",248.68,248.9],["this",248.9,249.14],["behaviour",249.14,249.56],["is",249.56,250.18],["very",250.18,250.5],["different",250.5,250.9],["to",250.9,251.4],["the",251.4,251.5],["way",251.5,251.68],["that",251.68,251.9],["animals",251.9,252.36]]},{"start":252.36,"end":253.52,"text":"sense things.","words":[["sense",252.36,253.04],["things.",253.04,253.52]]},{"start":258.87,"end":263.93,"text":"Another type of plant which can sense things in its surroundings is the Dodder plant.","words":[["Another",258.87,259.13],["type",259.13,259.41],["of",259.41,259.61],["plant",259.61,259.95],["which",259.95,260.25],["can",260.25,260.51],["sense",260.51,260.91],["things",260.91,261.39],["in",261.39,261.59],["its",261.59,261.71],["surroundings",261.71,262.13],["is",262.13,262.95],["the",262.95,263.11],["Dodder",263.11,263.59],["plant.",263.59,263.93]]},{"start":264.83,"end":269.09,"text":"This plant is different to most other species because it doesn't have the ability to","words":[["This",264.83,265.05],["plant",265.05,265.33],["is",265.33,265.51],["different",265.51,265.81],["to",265.81,266.03],["most",266.03,266.23],["other",266.23,266.47],["species",266.47,266.95],["because",266.95,267.61],["it",267.61,267.81],["doesn't",267.81,268.07],["have",268.07,268.29],["the",268.29,268.45],["ability",268.45,268.79],["to",268.79,269.09]]},{"start":269.09,"end":275.19,"text":"make sugar by converting nutrients from the soil. This means that as soon as the","words":[["make",269.09,269.37],["sugar",269.37,269.75],["by",269.75,270.35],["converting",270.35,270.83],["nutrients",270.83,271.39],["from",271.39,271.69],["the",271.69,271.81],["soil.",271.81,272.13],["This",273.15,273.43],["means",273.43,273.75],["that",273.75,274.47],["as",274.47,274.57],["soon",274.57,274.93],["as",274.93,275.07],["the",275.07,275.19]]},{"start":275.19,"end":280.09,"text":"dodder has sprouted from a seed it needs to find another plant in order to","words":[["dodder",275.19,275.61],["has",275.61,275.79],["sprouted",275.79,276.33],["from",276.33,276.49],["a",276.49,276.67],["seed",276.67,276.99],["it",276.99,277.63],["needs",277.63,277.85],["to",277.85,278.03],["find",278.03,278.19],["another",278.19,278.63],["plant",278.63,279.03],["in",279.03,279.65],["order",279.65,279.87],["to",279.87,280.09]]},{"start":280.09,"end":286.61,"text":"survive. In other words, it's a parasite. Dodders infest a variety of food","words":[["survive.",280.09,280.55],["In",281.45,281.55],["other",281.55,281.71],["words,",281.71,282.09],["it's",282.67,282.89],["a",282.89,282.95],["parasite.",282.95,283.41],["Dodders",284.49,284.93],["infest",284.93,285.67],["a",285.67,285.83],["variety",285.83,286.15],["of",286.15,286.45],["food",286.45,286.61]]},{"start":286.61,"end":291.23,"text":"crops around the world as they wrap themselves like string around their","words":[["crops",286.61,286.91],["around",286.91,287.23],["the",287.23,287.43],["world",287.43,287.83],["as",287.83,288.35],["they",288.35,288.49],["wrap",288.49,288.81],["themselves",288.81,289.17],["like",289.17,289.69],["string",289.69,290.13],["around",290.13,290.89],["their",290.89,291.23]]},{"start":291.23,"end":299.07,"text":"target plants and the effect can be devastating for farmers. It's","words":[["target",291.23,291.63],["plants",291.63,292.07],["and",292.07,292.77],["the",292.77,292.87],["effect",292.87,293.21],["can",293.21,293.79],["be",293.79,293.93],["devastating",293.93,294.47],["for",294.47,294.95],["farmers.",294.95,295.31],["It's",298.35,299.07]]},{"start":299.07,"end":302.37,"text":"as well as to potatoes and different varieties of citrus.","words":[["as",299.07,299.33],["well",299.33,299.47],["as",299.47,299.59],["to",299.59,299.71],["potatoes",299.71,300.15],["and",300.15,300.83],["different",300.83,301.31],["varieties",301.31,301.87],["of",301.87,302.09],["citrus.",302.09,302.37]]},{"start":303.63,"end":309.89,"text":"At first, scientists were puzzled as to how the dodder knows which plants to prey on.","words":[["At",303.63,304.11],["first,",304.11,304.45],["scientists",305.03,305.53],["were",305.53,306.05],["puzzled",306.05,306.61],["as",306.61,307.09],["to",307.09,307.23],["how",307.23,307.49],["the",307.49,307.73],["dodder",307.73,308.07],["knows",308.07,308.47],["which",308.47,308.89],["plants",308.89,309.25],["to",309.25,309.47],["prey",309.47,309.63],["on.",309.63,309.89]]},{"start":310.69,"end":314.53,"text":"But now they found that the plant can identify a suitable host","words":[["But",310.69,311.05],["now",311.05,311.23],["they",311.23,311.39],["found",311.39,311.69],["that",311.69,311.89],["the",311.89,311.97],["plant",311.97,312.31],["can",312.31,312.77],["identify",312.77,313.39],["a",313.39,313.67],["suitable",313.67,313.99],["host",313.99,314.53]]},{"start":314.95,"end":319.57,"text":"by sensing the chemicals that other plants release into the soil and air.","words":[["by",314.95,315.31],["sensing",315.31,315.69],["the",315.69,315.97],["chemicals",315.97,316.41],["that",316.41,316.91],["other",316.91,317.29],["plants",317.29,317.69],["release",317.69,318.05],["into",318.05,318.45],["the",318.45,318.61],["soil",318.61,318.93],["and",318.93,319.23],["air.",319.23,319.57]]},{"start":320.65,"end":325.81,"text":"What really surprised researchers was how extremely quickly and accurately the","words":[["What",320.65,321.27],["really",321.27,321.63],["surprised",321.63,321.93],["researchers",321.93,322.59],["was",322.59,323.25],["how",323.25,323.45],["extremely",323.45,323.99],["quickly",323.99,324.49],["and",324.49,324.85],["accurately",324.85,325.47],["the",325.47,325.81]]},{"start":325.81,"end":332.35,"text":"the dodder identifies a possible host. They used time-lapse videos to study the mechanism","words":[["the",325.81,325.91],["dodder",325.91,326.21],["identifies",326.21,326.91],["a",326.91,327.17],["possible",327.17,327.49],["host.",327.49,328.01],["They",328.99,329.17],["used",329.17,329.49],["time",329.49,329.93],["-lapse",329.93,330.29],["videos",330.29,330.73],["to",330.73,331.29],["study",331.29,331.65],["the",331.65,331.81],["mechanism",331.81,332.35]]},{"start":332.77,"end":338.03,"text":"and saw from these that when the dodder is trying to check out its environment, it rotates","words":[["and",332.77,333.11],["saw",333.11,333.33],["from",333.33,333.53],["these",333.53,333.75],["that",333.75,334.27],["when",334.27,334.45],["the",334.45,334.67],["dodder",334.67,335.01],["is",335.01,335.21],["trying",335.21,335.47],["to",335.47,335.65],["check",335.65,335.89],["out",335.89,336.09],["its",336.09,336.27],["environment,",336.27,336.81],["it",337.57,337.65],["rotates",337.65,338.03]]},{"start":338.03,"end":344.59,"text":"in a circle and then, without touching any other plants, it heads directly towards its","words":[["in",338.03,338.31],["a",338.31,338.47],["circle",338.47,338.81],["and",338.81,339.45],["then,",339.45,339.69],["without",340.29,340.55],["touching",340.55,340.91],["any",340.91,341.29],["other",341.29,341.49],["plants,",341.49,341.89],["it",342.63,342.75],["heads",342.75,343.07],["directly",343.07,343.63],["towards",343.63,344.21],["its",344.21,344.59]]},{"start":344.59,"end":352.25,"text":"selected host. It could sense reliably which type of plant it would grow best on. Scientists","words":[["selected",344.59,345.09],["host.",345.09,345.55],["It",346.45,346.75],["could",346.75,346.93],["sense",346.93,347.29],["reliably",347.29,347.99],["which",347.99,348.73],["type",348.73,349.11],["of",349.11,349.29],["plant",349.29,349.61],["it",349.61,349.97],["would",349.97,350.17],["grow",350.17,350.47],["best",350.47,350.75],["on.",350.75,351.05],["Scientists",351.83,352.25]]},{"start":352.25,"end":357.39,"text":"scientists who were working on the project reported that the dodder sprout resembled","words":[["scientists",352.25,352.47],["who",352.47,352.77],["were",352.77,352.89],["working",352.89,353.19],["on",353.19,353.39],["the",353.39,353.47],["project",353.47,353.83],["reported",353.83,354.79],["that",354.79,355.49],["the",355.49,355.63],["dodder",355.63,356.01],["sprout",356.01,356.31],["resembled",356.31,357.39]]},{"start":357.39,"end":360.33,"text":"a worm as it moved towards the other plant.","words":[["a",357.39,357.55],["worm",357.55,357.89],["as",357.89,358.49],["it",358.49,358.61],["moved",358.61,358.89],["towards",358.89,359.35],["the",359.35,359.77],["other",359.77,359.97],["plant.",359.97,360.33]]},{"start":361.59,"end":366.53,"text":"Well those are some examples of the new discoveries about plant characteristics.","words":[["Well",361.59,361.95],["those",361.95,362.27],["are",362.27,362.57],["some",362.57,362.97],["examples",362.97,363.49],["of",363.49,363.89],["the",363.89,364.03],["new",364.03,364.35],["discoveries",364.35,364.81],["about",364.81,365.23],["plant",365.23,365.69],["characteristics.",365.69,366.53]]},{"start":367.47,"end":371.47,"text":"So which direction is plant science likely to go in next?","words":[["So",367.47,367.85],["which",367.85,368.21],["direction",368.21,368.77],["is",368.77,369.19],["plant",369.19,369.49],["science",369.49,369.95],["likely",369.95,370.43],["to",370.43,370.77],["go",370.77,370.93],["in",370.93,371.07],["next?",371.07,371.47]]},{"start":372.21,"end":377.07,"text":"Many of the phenomena related to plant behaviour that I've just described are now quite","words":[["Many",372.21,372.59],["of",372.59,372.77],["the",372.77,372.87],["phenomena",372.87,373.21],["related",373.21,373.83],["to",373.83,374.05],["plant",374.05,374.27],["behaviour",374.27,374.65],["that",374.65,374.97],["I've",374.97,375.17],["just",375.17,375.35],["described",375.35,375.89],["are",375.89,376.55],["now",376.55,376.75],["quite",376.75,377.07]]},{"start":377.07,"end":380.15,"text":"easy to observe using up-to-date equipment.","words":[["easy",377.07,377.51],["to",377.51,377.77],["observe",377.77,378.21],["using",378.21,379.03],["up",379.03,379.37],["-to",379.37,379.53],["-date",379.53,379.71],["equipment.",379.71,380.15]]},{"start":380.15,"end":387.35,"text":"So, gradually, scientists are accepting the fact that plants are more capable than we","words":[["So,",380.15,381.37],["gradually,",381.73,382.33],["scientists",382.81,383.31],["are",383.31,383.85],["accepting",383.85,384.37],["the",384.37,384.63],["fact",384.63,384.87],["that",384.87,385.39],["plants",385.39,385.73],["are",385.73,386.19],["more",386.19,386.45],["capable",386.45,386.85],["than",386.85,387.21],["we",387.21,387.35]]},{"start":387.35,"end":388.01,"text":"used to believe.","words":[["used",387.35,387.59],["to",387.59,387.73],["believe.",387.73,388.01]]},{"start":388.87,"end":394.95,"text":"But although such plant behaviour is often obvious to some scientists…","words":[["But",388.87,389.29],["although",389.29,389.53],["such",389.53,389.95],["plant",389.95,390.29],["behaviour",390.29,390.67],["is",390.67,391.49],["often",391.49,391.95],["obvious",391.95,392.61],["to",392.61,393.33],["some",393.33,393.59],["scientists…",393.59,394.95]]},{"start":398.37,"end":400.43,"text":"That is the end of part four.","words":[["That",398.37,398.87],["is",398.87,399.07],["the",399.07,399.21],["end",399.21,399.59],["of",399.59,399.75],["part",399.75,399.99],["four.",399.99,400.43]]},{"start":401.25,"end":405.19,"text":"You now have one minute to check your answers to part four.","words":[["You",401.25,401.59],["now",401.59,401.89],["have",401.89,402.27],["one",402.27,402.59],["minute",402.59,403.01],["to",403.01,403.33],["check",403.33,403.65],["your",403.65,403.83],["answers",403.83,404.29],["to",404.29,404.55],["part",404.55,404.75],["four.",404.75,405.19]]},{"start":465.24,"end":467.44,"text":"That is the end of the listening test.","words":[["That",465.24,465.66],["is",465.66,465.84],["the",465.84,466.02],["end",466.02,466.46],["of",466.46,466.66],["the",466.66,466.8],["listening",466.8,467.04],["test.",467.04,467.44]]},{"start":467.44,"end":473.32,"text":"You now have 10 minutes to transfer your answers to the listening answer sheet.","words":[["You",467.44,468.5],["now",468.5,468.78],["have",468.78,469.22],["10",469.22,469.6],["minutes",469.6,469.98],["to",469.98,470.38],["transfer",470.38,470.92],["